jiru.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Nami qaxaramee huju","poem":1},{"text":"hujii ifii yennaa fixu akkuma gammadu,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"namille bara dadhabbii ifii keessa","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"akka gammadu ossiif.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"«Muki yoo murame","poem":1},{"text":"deebi'ee waan latuu fi","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"damee waan baafatuuf addii qaba.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"Hiddi isaa lafa keessatti dulloomulle,","poem":1},{"text":"jirmi isaalle biyyee keessatti gogulle,","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"foolee bisaaniitiin deebi'ee hin quunxa;","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"akka biqiltuu reef lattuulle","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"damee hin baafata.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"Nami ammoo du'ee hin bada;","poem":1},{"text":"eega du'e deebi'ee hin dhaggamu.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"Akkuma bisaan abbaayaa keessaa ol fiilee dhabamuutii fi","poem":1},{"text":"akka bisaan laga keessaa goguu,","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"akkasuma nami du'e","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"deebi'ee hin ka'u;","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ol-gubbaan haga dabartutti hin dammaqu;","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"yookiin hirriiba irraa hin ka'u.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"«Mufiin teeti haga dabartutti","poem":1},{"text":"addee worra du'eetitti adoo na dhossitee","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"guyyaa murteessitee","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"adoo na qaabatte hin fedhaayyu!","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"Nami eega du'e deebi'ee hin jiraataa ree?","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Haga foorri naa dhufutti,","poem":1},{"text":"bara dadhabbi'iin lafa irra le'u duudii","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ossaan hin eegadha'a.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"Ati na hin waanta;","poem":1},{"text":"anille hin owwaadha;","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ati hujii harka keetii na hin dharraata.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"Achiin duuba tarkaaffii tiyya duudii hin laakkotta;","poem":1},{"text":"cubbuu tiyya ammoo natti hin heddu","poem":2},{"noteId":10},{"text":".","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"Akka huura subba keessa keyamee gatamuu,","poem":1},{"text":"balleessaa tiyya duudii na irraa hin gatta;","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"cubbuu tiyyalle hin balleessita.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"Akkuma gaarri sigigaatee jijjigu,","poem":1},{"text":"akkuma rassaalle addee ifii irraa ka'u,","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"akkuma bisaan dhakaa qoqqotu","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"akkuma lolaan biyyee haru,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"atille akkasuma addii namaa hin balleessita.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"Hunni teeti haga bara baraa","poem":1},{"text":"isa irratti hin jabaatti;","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"innille hin du'a.","poem":2},{"text":"Bifa isaalle jijjiirtee","poem":1},{"text":"ifi duraa hin balleessita.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"Ilmaan isaa yoo ulfinna dhaggatanu,","poem":1},{"text":"inni hin beeku.","poem":2},{"text":"Yoo isaan salphatanulle","poem":1},{"text":"inni hin dhaggu.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"Dhibee nafa isaa qofatti itti dhage'ama;","poem":1},{"text":"inni ifi qofaaf bowa» jedhe.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":10,"caller":"+","text":"Hin heddu: Yookiin herreddu","reference":{"chapter":14,"verse":16}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/gax_twf/JOB/14.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/gax_twf/JOB/15.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/gax_twf/JOB/13.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}